    "ui": "explicit legacy policy for active eye presets, exact paged PNG and coverage verification, complete-preset comparison/ACK, invalidation on policy changes, query-only uncertain writes",
    "reads": "server and project recovery exact eye preset read exemption after existing guards; derived transport image gate never authorizes an apply",
    "neutral": "Original no-choice neutral route preserved; derived neutral scalar admission requires actual source/target identity but no active ridge/native/precompute prerequisite"
