    "Generic batch/cohort and unreviewed shared aliases/dormant affected documents remain guarded.",
    "Simultaneous active eye-bag and collarbone/body-scalar special review families require separate transactions; selected effects are not silently omitted.",
    "Full source is rendered before <=1024-edge RGB8 display reduction; existing memory/opaque SDR/codec limits remain, no HDR/alpha or native-pixel quality claim.",
